  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements :\nStatement (I) : Dimensions of specific heat is $\\left[\\mathrm{L}^2 \\mathrm{~T}^{-2} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1}\\right]$.\nStatement (II) : Dimensions of gas constant is $\\left[\\mathrm{M} \\mathrm{L}^2 \\mathrm{~T}^{-1} \\mathrm{~K}^{-1}\\right]$.\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below.",
    "image": null
  },
